7
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:51,860
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:57,910
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,220 --> 00:01:02,710
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:10,980
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:14,020
=Episode 9=

12
00:01:15,510 --> 00:01:16,179
(Why can my blood)

13
00:01:16,221 --> 00:01:18,150
(awaken the wickless Myriad Souls Lamp?)

14
00:01:19,040 --> 00:01:20,459
(How did Song Ziyuan know)

15
00:01:20,501 --> 00:01:21,760
(my blood is different from others'?)

16
00:01:22,790 --> 00:01:23,710
(Who exactly)

17
00:01:24,350 --> 00:01:25,590
(is my mother?)

18
00:01:40,480 --> 00:01:41,950
My heart hurts so much.

19
00:01:42,790 --> 00:01:44,000
Why does it hurt so much?

20
00:02:01,710 --> 00:02:02,310
(Not good.)

21
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:04,590
(This will only make Chu Li
awaken the Chu Phoenix Call sooner.)

22
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:08,430
(Li,)

23
00:02:08,870 --> 00:02:10,280
(I don't have much time left.)

24
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:11,630
(I have to find a way)

25
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:13,339
(to get you out of Jinan City soon.)

26
00:02:13,381 --> 00:02:16,540
(30 Days Before the City Falls)

27
00:02:28,870 --> 00:02:29,630
So, now,

28
00:02:31,630 --> 00:02:33,400
have we completely swapped back?

29
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,360
If the lamp oil runs out,

30
00:02:36,590 --> 00:02:37,360
I'm afraid...

31
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:40,800
It's fine.

32
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:43,030
My blood won't run dry anytime soon.

33
00:02:54,590 --> 00:02:55,470
How can you...

34
00:02:56,150 --> 00:02:57,470
I was kind enough to save you,

35
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:58,910
and you can't even say thanks?

36
00:02:59,310 --> 00:03:00,560
All that blood wasted.

37
00:03:05,430 --> 00:03:07,680
I just want him to come with me
to see my mother.

38
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,400
He should agree, right?

39
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,470
I wanted to ask... are you free?

40
00:03:21,430 --> 00:03:22,520
I mean,

41
00:03:22,910 --> 00:03:24,190
I want to go see my mother again.

42
00:03:24,590 --> 00:03:26,190
But I'm afraid
Yun Hua will give me a hard time.

43
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,630
How about you come with me?

44
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,080
I have things to do.

45
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:38,280
Maybe another time.

46
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:42,520
Another time?

47
00:03:43,630 --> 00:03:44,630
What's that supposed to mean?

48
00:03:45,710 --> 00:03:47,120
I didn't do anything to offend him.

49
00:03:52,470 --> 00:03:53,080
Chu Li,

50
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:54,800
you're no longer
part of our Shaman Clan.

51
00:03:55,150 --> 00:03:56,240
You want to see the Grand Shaman?

52
00:03:56,430 --> 00:03:57,190
Dream on.

53
00:03:57,630 --> 00:03:58,280
Yun Hua,

54
00:03:58,470 --> 00:04:00,280
did I dig up your family's graves
in a past life?

55
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:02,150
Do you have to hate me this much
in this life?

56
00:04:02,710 --> 00:04:03,750
Don't try to provoke me.

57
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,710
Threats or sweet talk won't work on me.

58
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:06,710
It's useless.

59
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,000
(If I'd known,)

60
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:12,030
(I really should have dug up your
family's graves in my previous life.)

61
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:31,510
Chu Li.

62
00:04:33,190 --> 00:04:34,270
How did you get hurt?

63
00:04:35,430 --> 00:04:36,430
Let me put some medicine on it.

64
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:37,920
It must be hard to do it yourself.

65
00:04:38,510 --> 00:04:40,160
Just a small wound. It's fine.

66
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:44,750
Does it hurt?

67
00:04:45,070 --> 00:04:45,830
It's okay.

68
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:54,800
If you'd come with me
to the Shaman Clan today,

69
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,360
Would Yun Hua have dared
treat me like that?

70
00:04:57,270 --> 00:04:58,160
Miss Chu Li,

71
00:04:58,480 --> 00:05:00,000
I'm not obligated to stay by your side

72
00:05:00,070 --> 00:05:01,950
and solve all your problems.

73
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,310
Song Ziyuan, you...

74
00:05:04,870 --> 00:05:06,270
What's the meaning of this?

75
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:08,750
(Why is Song Ziyuan)

76
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:10,800
(so strange today?)

77
00:05:11,830 --> 00:05:12,870
I'll be gentle.

78
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:18,270
Diviner Song? What brings you here?

79
00:05:28,870 --> 00:05:30,390
What's going on with Diviner Song?

80
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:31,950
He seems to be in a bad mood.

81
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,190
Song Ziyuan,

82
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:47,680
did something happen to you?

83
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:49,510
Let go.

84
00:05:55,630 --> 00:05:56,950
I have official matters to attend to.

85
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,720
Please don't disturb me, miss.

86
00:05:59,070 --> 00:06:00,480
What's the matter with you?

87
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:01,560
You were fine just days ago.

88
00:06:01,630 --> 00:06:02,920
Why the sudden change?

89
00:06:03,190 --> 00:06:04,680
Did I offend you somehow?

90
00:06:05,950 --> 00:06:06,680
No.

91
00:06:09,630 --> 00:06:10,480
Song Ziyuan,

92
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,510
I hate guessing games.

93
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:13,870
Just say what you mean.

94
00:06:15,950 --> 00:06:16,680
Get out.

95
00:06:19,310 --> 00:06:20,070
Fine.

96
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:29,920
(Li,)

97
00:06:31,190 --> 00:06:32,920
(I really am running out of time.)

98
00:06:43,430 --> 00:06:46,000
What's wrong with Song Ziyuan?

99
00:06:46,510 --> 00:06:48,000
Has someone put a curse on him?

100
00:06:48,430 --> 00:06:49,430
Here, take the money.

101
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:50,240
Leave quickly.

102
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:51,630
Don't come back again.

103
00:06:51,830 --> 00:06:53,190
I'm not leaving. Take your money back.

104
00:06:53,430 --> 00:06:54,000
I'm telling you,

105
00:06:54,070 --> 00:06:55,190
wherever Chu Li goes, I go.

106
00:06:57,390 --> 00:06:59,270
- I said take it.
- I don't want it!

107
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:00,270
- Take it!
- Chu Li!

108
00:07:01,430 --> 00:07:02,120
What's wrong?

109
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:03,600
He...

110
00:07:04,270 --> 00:07:05,160
He told me

111
00:07:05,630 --> 00:07:07,120
Diviner Song wants me
to leave this place

112
00:07:07,390 --> 00:07:08,680
and never come back.

113
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:10,510
Why?

114
00:07:11,310 --> 00:07:12,040
I don't know.

115
00:07:12,630 --> 00:07:14,000
Maybe he's afraid I'll cling to you.

116
00:07:15,390 --> 00:07:16,120
Shiqi,

117
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:18,190
why does Song Ziyuan
want to send Fusheng away?

118
00:07:18,830 --> 00:07:19,600
I'll go talk to him.

119
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:21,040
Miss Chu Li, wait.

120
00:07:22,430 --> 00:07:23,680
My master wants

121
00:07:23,950 --> 00:07:25,270
you and Fusheng to leave together.

122
00:07:26,870 --> 00:07:27,630
What?

123
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:33,430
Today,

124
00:07:33,870 --> 00:07:35,430
I overheard Shiqi say

125
00:07:35,950 --> 00:07:37,510
that someone invited Diviner Song
to a banquet

126
00:07:37,830 --> 00:07:38,830
at Huancai Pavilion.

127
00:07:39,510 --> 00:07:40,240
Where?

128
00:07:40,830 --> 00:07:41,750
Huancai Pavilion.

129
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:47,600
Come on. Cheers.

130
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:48,240
Cheers.

131
00:07:54,430 --> 00:07:55,560
Diviner Song, I heard

132
00:07:56,310 --> 00:07:58,830
you took leave recently due to illness.

133
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:01,430
How is your health now?

134
00:08:02,190 --> 00:08:03,120
Much better.

135
00:08:03,630 --> 00:08:04,310
Good.

136
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:06,240
Diviner Song,

137
00:08:06,750 --> 00:08:09,800
you rarely join us for drinks and music.

138
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,310
It's a great honor

139
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:13,160
to have you here today.

140
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:13,920
- Indeed.
- Let's drink.

141
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:14,720
- Another toast to you.
- Cheers.

142
00:08:14,830 --> 00:08:15,360
Bottoms up.

143
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:47,700
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

144
00:08:48,170 --> 00:08:51,760
♪Night dew cold♪
(Xizhao)

145
00:08:53,850 --> 00:08:58,630
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

146
00:08:59,010 --> 00:09:01,940
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

147
00:09:02,650 --> 00:09:06,740
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

148
00:09:07,590 --> 00:09:10,410
♪Vows sink deep♪

149
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:16,460
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

150
00:09:16,770 --> 00:09:21,260
♪Covering the realm♪

151
00:09:36,270 --> 00:09:37,030
Diviner Song,

152
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:38,750
this is Huancai Pavilion's

153
00:09:38,870 --> 00:09:41,270
most renowned beauty, Xizhao.

154
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:42,840
It's your first time here.

155
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:45,000
I suppose you haven't met her before.

156
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:03,550
Diviner Song, you're so handsome.

157
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:06,600
Why are you so afraid of me?

158
00:10:20,360 --> 00:10:21,670
Chu Li, look.

159
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:23,360
Diviner Song really is here.

160
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,509
But Diviner Song is probably here

161
00:10:27,551 --> 00:10:28,510
on official business.

162
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:29,630
I don't think

163
00:10:29,750 --> 00:10:31,670
he's that debauched.

164
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:32,870
What's it to me?

165
00:10:34,750 --> 00:10:35,750
Who are you?

166
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:37,600
We've booked the whole place today.

167
00:10:38,120 --> 00:10:38,600
We...

168
00:10:38,670 --> 00:10:39,510
We got the wrong place.

169
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:45,550
Sorry about that, Diviner Song.

170
00:10:45,670 --> 00:10:46,670
We shouldn't have let them
spoil your evening.

171
00:10:46,790 --> 00:10:48,270
Here, let me toast you again.

172
00:11:11,550 --> 00:11:12,510
First comb,

173
00:11:13,150 --> 00:11:14,550
to reach the netherworld.

174
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:17,600
Second comb,

175
00:11:18,670 --> 00:11:20,200
the ghost paints its skin.

176
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:23,150
Third comb,

177
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:25,320
a wish becomes a prophecy.

178
00:11:27,270 --> 00:11:28,390
Fourth comb,

179
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:31,150
steal heaven's will.

180
00:11:56,360 --> 00:12:00,000
You will get what you desire.

181
00:12:05,440 --> 00:12:07,600
Mercury veils Tianshu.

182
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:09,390
The Moon...

183
00:12:10,750 --> 00:12:12,320
The Moon...

184
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:14,030
What comes after the Moon again?

185
00:12:16,240 --> 00:12:18,790
This astrological verse
is so hard to memorize.

186
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:20,320
So annoying.

187
00:12:20,510 --> 00:12:21,729
(Why have strange images)

188
00:12:21,771 --> 00:12:23,670
(been flashing through my mind lately?)

189
00:12:23,750 --> 00:12:25,440
(Could these be things
that will happen in the future?)

190
00:12:27,440 --> 00:12:28,120
(Li!)

191
00:12:29,390 --> 00:12:31,840
(How could this be the future?)

192
00:12:33,150 --> 00:12:33,870
(Impossible.)

193
00:12:34,360 --> 00:12:35,440
(That Song Ziyuan...)

194
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:38,200
(I just used the Myriad Souls Lamp
to restore his soul,)

195
00:12:38,750 --> 00:12:40,510
(and he turned so cold right away.)

196
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:42,270
(As if he deserves my kindness.)

197
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:50,840
If you don't want me here,

198
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:52,080
I'll just leave.

199
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:53,600
So I won't be a bother.

200
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,080
Don't go.

201
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:57,630
You're drunk?

202
00:12:58,510 --> 00:12:59,670
Don't go.

203
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:03,360
Stop laughing.

204
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:05,200
I'm going back.

205
00:13:10,960 --> 00:13:11,960
What are you doing?

206
00:13:12,910 --> 00:13:13,910
Li,

207
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:16,870
I'm so tired.

208
00:13:18,840 --> 00:13:20,510
Are you crying?

209
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:22,270
Li,

210
00:13:23,390 --> 00:13:24,510
what should I do?

211
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:27,600
What am I supposed to do?

212
00:13:30,520 --> 00:13:32,229
♪You come treading through snow♪

213
00:13:32,271 --> 00:13:33,240
Song Ziyuan,

214
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:36,120
what exactly
is the secret you're hiding?

215
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:37,550
Li,

216
00:13:38,790 --> 00:13:41,670
when that sword went in,

217
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:44,480
did it hurt?

218
00:13:47,390 --> 00:13:49,059
It hurt me too.

219
00:13:49,101 --> 00:13:49,960
(I'm sorry.)

220
00:14:23,960 --> 00:14:24,840
Chu Li?

221
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:32,150
What is it?

222
00:14:32,750 --> 00:14:34,600
Before the night Yun Hua
made things difficult for me,

223
00:14:35,270 --> 00:14:36,200
did you know me?

224
00:14:38,630 --> 00:14:39,360
No.

225
00:14:40,150 --> 00:14:41,080
No?

226
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:43,200
Song Ziyuan,

227
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:46,360
I have many ways
to make you tell the truth.

228
00:14:48,080 --> 00:14:49,270
What do you want me to say?

229
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:50,670
In my previous life,

230
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:52,080
why did you kill me?

231
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:54,270
Your previous life?

232
00:14:55,390 --> 00:14:56,080
Yes.

233
00:14:56,750 --> 00:14:57,480
In my previous life,

234
00:14:57,670 --> 00:14:59,720
I used the Chu Phoenix Call
to reverse time.

235
00:15:00,510 --> 00:15:01,910
Don't tell me you don't know.

236
00:15:03,480 --> 00:15:04,870
I don't know what you're talking about.

237
00:15:05,910 --> 00:15:07,360
Then what did you mean last night?

238
00:15:10,750 --> 00:15:11,910
I was drunk last night.

239
00:15:12,440 --> 00:15:13,200
I don't remember.

240
00:15:15,510 --> 00:15:16,480
Song Ziyuan,

241
00:15:17,870 --> 00:15:19,910
don't think I wouldn't dare kill you.

242
00:15:29,640 --> 00:15:35,310
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

243
00:15:36,930 --> 00:15:42,390
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

244
00:15:44,010 --> 00:15:47,240
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

245
00:15:47,410 --> 00:15:50,720
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

246
00:15:50,850 --> 00:15:56,630
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

247
00:15:58,090 --> 00:16:03,310
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

248
00:16:05,170 --> 00:16:11,360
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

249
00:16:11,610 --> 00:16:15,120
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

250
00:16:15,170 --> 00:16:18,459
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

251
00:16:18,501 --> 00:16:25,440
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

252
00:16:25,690 --> 00:16:29,000
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

253
00:16:29,330 --> 00:16:33,240
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

254
00:16:33,290 --> 00:16:39,600
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

255
00:17:08,670 --> 00:17:15,459
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

256
00:17:15,501 --> 00:17:21,680
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪
